# Data Science Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on data analysis and machine learning techniques to extract insights and build predictive models.

## 🛠 Technologies Used

* Python (Pandas, NumPy)
* Matplotlib / Seaborn
* Scikit-learn / XGBoost
* SQL
* Jupyter Notebook

## 📊 Project Steps

1. Data Collection
2. Data Cleaning & Preprocessing
3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
4. Model Building
5. Evaluation & Results

## 🚀 Results

The project identifies patterns in the dataset and builds predictive models to support decision-making.
